# Every text file is LF in the repo and on every checkout: a Windows
# runner's default autocrlf turned .zig files into CRLF and `zig fmt
# --check` failed before anything ran. Binaries are marked so git never
# touches them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ttf binary
*.gif binary
*.bundle binary
*.xz binary
*.zip binary
